# Production build target.
#
# The dev server leaves VITE_API_ORIGIN blank so requests go through the Vite
# proxy. A packaged app has no dev server, so the bundle must address the live
# Laravel origin directly. CapacitorHttp routes those requests through the
# native HTTP stack, which sidesteps browser CORS and keeps the session cookie.
#
# Changed from libtrack.laravel.cloud to the production deployment. That host
# stopped serving the app and now answers 404 with an empty body from
# Cloudflare, so every request in the APK would have failed. Verified against
# the new origin before switching: /login, /mobile/login and
# /mobile/register/lookup-lrn all respond (419 on POST is the CSRF response
# the existing bootstrap already handles).
VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://libtrack-production-fjky27.laravel.cloud
LIBTRACK_LARAVEL_ORIGIN=https://libtrack-production-fjky27.laravel.cloud